====================================================================
 1
Create a report that displays EMPNO, ENAME, DEPTNO of employees who
work with that Employee. (Nested Sub Query)
====================================================================

SQL Command:
------------
sql> SELECT EMPNO, ENAME, DEPTNO
     FROM EMP
     WHERE DEPTNO =
     (
         SELECT DEPTNO
         FROM EMP
         WHERE ENAME = 'SCOTT'
     );

Output:
-------

EMPNO   ENAME    DEPTNO
------  -------  ------
7369    SMITH      20
7566    JONES      20
7788    SCOTT      20
7876    ADAMS      20
7902    FORD       20


