 3
Display the ENAME, JOB who are Managers.
(Use EXISTS Operator)
====================================================================

SQL Command:
------------
sql> SELECT E1.ENAME, E1.JOB
     FROM EMP E1
     WHERE EXISTS
     (
         SELECT 1
         FROM EMP E2
         WHERE E2.EMPNO = E1.EMPNO
         AND E1.JOB = 'MANAGER'
     );

Output:
-------

ENAME    JOB
-------- --------
JONES    MANAGER
BLAKE    MANAGER
CLARK    MANAGER


