 16
Display the employees who earn a salary less than the average
salary of their respective department. Also display the average
salary.
(Use Inline Views)
====================================================================

SQL Command:
------------
sql> SELECT E.EMPNO,
            E.ENAME,
            E.SAL,
            D.AVGSAL
     FROM EMP E,
     (
         SELECT DEPTNO,
                AVG(SAL) AVGSAL
         FROM EMP
         GROUP BY DEPTNO
     ) D
     WHERE E.DEPTNO=D.DEPTNO
     AND E.SAL<D.AVGSAL;

