 17
Write a query that displays the LOC of those departments that have
a sum of salary less than the average salary of all employees in
the EMP table.
(Use WITH Clause)
====================================================================

SQL Command:
------------
sql> WITH DEPT_TOTAL AS
     (
         SELECT DEPTNO,
                SUM(SAL) TOTALSAL
         FROM EMP
         GROUP BY DEPTNO
     )
     SELECT D.LOC
     FROM DEPT D,
          DEPT_TOTAL DT
     WHERE D.DEPTNO=DT.DEPTNO
     AND DT.TOTALSAL <
     (
         SELECT AVG(SAL)
         FROM EMP
     );

